                <pb facs="0761" n="645" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg645"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 703.3212/11.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President of the American Colony at Mexico City to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-05-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 23, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Meeting American Colony voted grateful thanks to Brazilian Minister for untiring,
                    splendid services rendered Americans and watchful care in their behalf.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">C. H. M. y Agramonte</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
